# Intentionally rule-free. This site is PRE-RENDERED: Cloudflare Pages has a
# real file for every address, so there is nothing to catch.
#
# Do NOT add the `/*  /index.html  200` splat here. That rule is load-bearing on
# a plain SPA and a bug on this project: Pages serves each name.html natively
# and its extension-strip redirect re-matches any rule targeting a .html file,
# which 308-loops forever.
#
# Unmatched addresses should fall through to dist/404.html.
